{"4449240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "49DAYS", "steam_appid": 4449240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras/aab39544d35d1d2dee8c5d1124902318.avif?t=1788261591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras_big/aab39544d35d1d2dee8c5d1124902318.webp?t=1788261591 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Awaken with no memory, sentenced to serve as the master of a teahouse in the afterlife.</strong> For 49 days, you must serve the final cup of tea to the departed while confronting the truths of the past you once ignored. Explore a strange, modern afterlife where trains replace ferries and economic activity replaces traditional punishment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras/b699211f451980863b1981bcc5d2152b.avif?t=1788261591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras_big/b699211f451980863b1981bcc5d2152b.webp?t=1788261591 width=1560 height=873 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Authentic Tea Brewing System</strong> Experience a deep crafting system inspired by real traditional tea-making. Master the art of <strong>withering, rolling, oxidation, and temperature control</strong> to create the perfect brew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras/82099a6066dc2329702bc9e9a096ee75.avif?t=1788261591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras_big/82099a6066dc2329702bc9e9a096ee75.webp?t=1788261591 width=1560 height=932 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Over 50 Unique Recipes</strong> Experiment with various tea leaves and additional ingredients to discover more than 50 different types of tea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras/f69c1ecce676674998994c64350dfa1e.avif?t=1788261591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras_big/f69c1ecce676674998994c64350dfa1e.webp?t=1788261591 width=1560 height=974 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Even a master brewer makes mistakes—perfection takes practice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras/bf45f67519aff2c1a8385b1a0a672df7.avif?t=1788261591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras_big/bf45f67519aff2c1a8385b1a0a672df7.webp?t=1788261591 width=1560 height=707 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage the Nighttime Teahouse</strong> As night falls, unique spirits with their own hidden secrets will visit. Earn their trust through conversation and gifts to influence their fates and change their endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras/afcd668ebc873aedb213a8d80dc86342.avif?t=1788261591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras_big/afcd668ebc873aedb213a8d80dc86342.webp?t=1788261591 width=1560 height=739 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Modern Afterlife</strong> A teahouse owner’s work never ends! During the day, venture outside to explore the mysterious world and gather rare ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras/e6e68c38f1b1e24693c81ba4de0ebf51.avif?t=1788261591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras_big/e6e68c38f1b1e24693c81ba4de0ebf51.webp?t=1788261591 width=1560 height=905 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests and Commerce</strong> Complete requests from various spirits to deepen your bonds or earn a steady income. Discovering secret recipes through rare materials might just be the key to your journey.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras/aab39544d35d1d2dee8c5d1124902318.avif?t=1788261591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449240/extras_big/aab39544d35d1d2dee8c5d1124902318.webp?t=1788261591 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Awaken with no memory, sentenced to serve as the master of a teahouse in the afterlife.</strong> For 49 days, you must serve the final cup of tea to the departed while confronting the truths of the past you once ignored. Explore a strange, modern afterlife where trains replace ferries and economic activity replaces traditional punishment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\